// register parameter - which is precisely the fpGameLoopFunction funcdef's shape.
// @evidence It previously carried convention 'unknown' with an extra ESI parameter, so its arity
// read 2 against the funcdef's 1. That ESI parameter was fabricated: the body never reads it, and
// both references (00460568, 00460608) only register the address with MOV ECX,0x460490 / CALL
// 00451bb0 - neither loads ESI. Here the funcdef was right and the implementation was the outlier.
